		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Crimson hawk-man with four feathered wings, a barbed tail, and a black scepter. Demon lord of harpies and chaotic avians.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 17, <strong>HP</strong> 96, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 scepter +10 (2d8+3) or 3 dark ray (far) +10 (2d8+3), <strong>MV</strong> far (fly), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> +6, <strong>W</strong> +6, <strong>Ch</strong> +6, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 20</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Profane Wishcraft</strong>. Cast wish for a mortal, no spellcasting check. Mortal becomes chaotic, demonically tainted.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pure Evil</strong>. Only damaged by silver weapons or magic sources. Immune to acid, cold, and fire.</p><p></p><p><strong>Wind Mastery</strong>. Flying creatures hearing Pazuzu, CHA 18+ or utterly charmed for 1d8 days.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
